{"id":"n64597-1-17","stage":0,"title":"수업 · 课程","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64597-1-17-1","ko":"우리 오늘 학교 끝나고 운동장에서 놀자.","zh":"我们今天放学后去操场玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나고","meaning":"放学后","explanation":"끝나다：结束；学校的课程结束即放学，-고 连接后面的活动。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나고","audio":"/audio/02bfa899d696ea03947a.mp3"}},{"text":"운동장에서","meaning":"在操场","explanation":"운동장：操场；-에서 表示活动发生的地点。","readings":[{"term":"운동장","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26891","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동장에서","audio":"/audio/64c1c5085fe644a25d12.mp3"}},{"text":"놀자.","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀자","audio":"/audio/427799fc27c8f312f572.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"下课，下班","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"在学校或公司等地方做完当天的功课或业务。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"899e5787d5587fd1","term":"운동장","zh":"运动场，体育场","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3","entryId":"26891","definition":"为能够进行体育比赛、游玩等而设有多种器具或设施的宽阔场所。","pronunciation":["운ː동장"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a0209e9c8396e13c6435.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64597-1-17-2","ko":"안 돼. 나 오늘 학원 수업이 있어.","zh":"不行，我今天有补习班的课。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：否定副词，与后面的 돼 合用为“不行”。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"不行","explanation":"안 돼：不行；这里表示因为有补习班的课而不能去玩。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/aud